  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-01-27T20:46:24.131Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The instruction on the website on how to create avatars and worlds is very out of date and left me searching around on the web for hours. I eventually had to figure most of it out my self and from the very few sources of information out there (i.e. only a few different yt videos available). It would also help to make it easier to make avatars/world instead of having to find the exact Unity/Blender version and figuring out how the person in the yt video got to where they are because you can't find that in your version or how they got color on their avatar in Blender and you followed the steps and it isn't working and things like that. Way too many hoops to jump through for this one thing that should be very simple.",
